# Requests for the WebApi sample. Start it first: dotnet run --project samples/WebApi
@host = http://localhost:5080

### What the service runs on
GET {{host}}/info

### Clean a scanned page for OCR (the answer is a PNG)
POST {{host}}/preprocess
Content-Type: image/png

< ../images/old-page.png

### Layout of a newspaper page: text blocks, text lines and pictures
POST {{host}}/layout
Content-Type: image/png

< ../images/newspaper.png

### Not an image: 400 with a problem description
POST {{host}}/preprocess
Content-Type: text/plain

hello
